  <h3 style="margin-top: 20px;">Note on HSA Participation:</h3>
  <p style="line-height: 1.5;">If you contribute to an HSA, you are ineligible to participate in the medical FSA. If your spouse or other dependent is enrolled in a high-deductible health plan/HSA through his or her employer or another source, you should not elect to participate in the employer's medical FSA for the plan year, or else your spouse or other dependent will be ineligible for the HSA.</p>
